---
layout: default
---
<main class="portfolio-home home-pavilion">
  {%- comment -%} 1 — ABOUT / HERO {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <h1 id="home-title" class="home-hero__title">
        Hi <span class="wave" aria-hidden="true">👋</span>, I&rsquo;m <span class="hl-accent">Yiran</span> &mdash; a
        <span class="hl-marker">product</span> <span class="amp">&amp;</span> <span class="hl-knock">AI</span>
        <span class="hl-underline">builder</span> with a background in <span class="hl-accent">cognitive science,</span>
        building thoughtful technology for deeply
        <span class="serif">human contexts.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="home-hero__lede">
        My work moves between implementation and inquiry. Both begin with
        <span class="serif">close observation</span> &mdash; of behavior, communities, and the systems around us.
      </p>
      <div class="route-actions">
        <a class="route-button route-button--dark" href="{{ '/build/' | relative_url }}">See what I build <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="route-button" href="{{ '/understand/' | relative_url }}">See what I study <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="home-hero__portrait">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/prof_pic.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="Portrait of Yiran Gong">
    </figure>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 2 — SELECTED WORK {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="section-block work-block" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--inline">
      <div>
        <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2 id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Structured so the problem, contribution, methods, and evidence are visible before you open the full case study.</p>
    </div>

    {% assign featured_projects = site.projects | where: 'featured', true | sort: 'importance' %}
    {% if featured_projects.size > 0 %}
      <div class="project-index">
        {% for project in featured_projects %}
          {% include project-card.liquid project=project %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="framework-message">Selected projects remain unpublished until their content and evidence are ready.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 3 — CAPABILITIES IN CONTEXT + CONTACT {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="section-block capability-board" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--inline">
      <div>
        <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2 id="capabilities-title">Capabilities in context</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Skills stay attached to the projects and evidence that demonstrate them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-rows">
      <div class="cap-row cap-row--build">
        <div class="cap-row__head">
          <div class="cap-row__title">
            <span class="cap-row__num">01</span>
            <h3>Making</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="cap-row__desc">Shipping AI products end-to-end — from model choice to instrumentation.</p>
          <p class="cap-row__evidence"><span>DEMONSTRATED IN</span> <a href="{{ '/build/' | relative_url }}">Gen-AI video · Analytics ↗</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="cap-row__tags">
          <span>AI workflows</span><span>Product operations</span><span>Model evaluation</span><span>Prompt design</span
          ><span>Testing &amp; deployment</span><span>Instrumentation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cap-row cap-row--understand">
        <div class="cap-row__head">
          <div class="cap-row__title">
            <span class="cap-row__num">02</span>
            <h3>Investigating</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="cap-row__desc">Formal study of how people think, decide, and interact.</p>
          <p class="cap-row__evidence">
            <span>DEMONSTRATED IN</span> <a href="{{ '/understand/' | relative_url }}">Cognitive-science research ↗</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cap-row__tags">
          <span>Human collaboration</span><span>Computational modeling</span><span>Reinforcement learning</span><span>Bayesian models</span
          ><span>Evaluation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cap-row cap-row--connect">
        <div class="cap-row__head">
          <div class="cap-row__title">
            <span class="cap-row__num">03</span>
            <h3>Connecting</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="cap-row__desc">Growing trust and translating between people and systems.</p>
          <p class="cap-row__evidence"><span>DEMONSTRATED IN</span> <a href="{{ '/build/' | relative_url }}">Community growth 0→500+ ↗</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="cap-row__tags">
          <span>Community trust</span><span>Close observation</span><span>Cultural systems</span><span>Synthesis</span><span>Communication</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-contact" aria-labelledby="home-contact-title">
    <div class="home-contact__main">
      <span class="home-contact__eyebrow">CONTACT</span>
      <h2 id="home-contact-title">I work where technical systems meet <span class="serif">human behavior.</span></h2>
      <div class="route-actions">
        {% if site.email -%}
          <a class="route-button route-button--light" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Get in touch <span>↗</span></a>
        {%- endif %}
        <a class="route-button route-button--ghost" href="{{ '/cv/' | relative_url }}">Curriculum vitae <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-contact__meta">
      <div>
        <span class="home-contact__label">AVAILABLE FOR</span>
        <p>Product &amp; AI roles · 2026</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="home-contact__label">ELSEWHERE</span>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/yirangong">GitHub ↗</a> · <a href="{{ '/cv/' | relative_url }}">CV ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
